Cell["\<\
The pairing object is a positional argument, not an option, and it must come \
last. Omitting it leaves the product unevaluated rather than raising a \
message.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"67029894-6f33-4c79-b543-30b92c50b149"],

